<body>
<div class="topbar"><div class="wrap"><span>VISUAL STORYTELLING FOR AMBITIOUS BRANDS</span><span>JAKARTA, INDONESIA · MON–SAT 09.00–18.00</span></div></div>
<header><nav class="nav wrap"><a href="#home" class="logo">◎ NOIR STUDIO<small>PHOTO &amp; VIDEO</small></a><div class="links" id="links"><a href="#home">Home</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#portfolio">Portfolio</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></div><a class="btn gold" href="#contact">Book a Session ↗</a><button class="menu" id="menu">☰</button></nav></header>
<main>
<section class="hero" id="home"><div class="wrap"><div class="hero-inner"><div class="eyebrow">Product photography &amp; videography</div><h1>Turn Your Product<br>into a <em>Visual Story.</em></h1><p>We create stunning product photos and videos that highlight your brand’s uniqueness, elevate your value, and make a lasting impression.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn gold" href="#contact">Get a Quote →</a><a class="btn outline" href="#portfolio">View Portfolio</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="services" id="services"><div class="wrap service-grid"><div class="service"><div class="symbol">◎</div><h3>Product Photography</h3><p>High-quality photos with professional lighting &amp; styling.</p></div><div class="service"><div class="symbol">▷</div><h3>Product Videography</h3><p>Cinematic videos to showcase your product in motion.</p></div><div class="service"><div class="symbol">✧</div><h3>Creative Direction</h3><p>Concept &amp; styling for unique visual storytelling.</p></div><div class="service"><div class="symbol">↗</div><h3>Post-Production</h3><p>Color grading, editing &amp; retouching for perfection.</p></div><div class="service"><div class="symbol">◷</div><h3>Fast Delivery</h3><p>On-time delivery with professional results.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="portfolio"><div class="wrap"><div class="portfolio-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Our portfolio</div><h2 class="heading">Featured Works.</h2></div><div><p>A selection of product visuals crafted with creativity and attention to detail.</p><a class="btn outline" href="#contact">View All Projects →</a></div></div><div class="works">
<a class="work" href="#contact"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594035910387-fea47794261f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=85" alt="Pemotretan parfum"><h3>Beauty &amp; Skincare ↗</h3><p>Product Photography</p></a>
<a class="work" href="#contact"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584917865442-de89df76afd3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=85" alt="Pemotretan tas fashion"><h3>Fashion &amp; Apparel ↗</h3><p>Product Photography</p></a>
<a class="work" href="#contact"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517701604599-bb29b565090c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=85" alt="Pemotretan minuman"><h3>Food &amp; Beverage ↗</h3><p>Product Videography</p></a>
<a class="work" href="#contact"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505740420928-5e560c06d30e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=85" alt="Pemotretan headphone"><h3>Tech &amp; Gadget ↗</h3><p>Product Photography</p></a>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section about" id="about"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div class="photos"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516035069371-29a1b244cc32?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=85" alt="Kamera profesional"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492619375914-88005aa9e8fb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=85" alt="Peralatan studio"></div><div><div class="eyebrow">About Noir Studio</div><h2 class="heading">More Than Just Photos,<br>It’s a Visual Experience.</h2><p class="copy">Noir Studio specializes in product photography and videography. We help brands tell their story through compelling visuals, creativity, precision, and professional equipment.</p><a class="btn gold" href="#contact">Learn More →</a></div><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong>500+</strong><span>Projects Completed</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>200+</strong><span>Happy Clients</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>5 Years</strong><span>Experience</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section faq" id="faq"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="heading">Frequently Asked<br>Questions.</h2><p class="copy">Temukan jawaban seputar layanan, proses produksi, dan pemesanan.</p><a class="btn outline" href="#contact">Ask Us More →</a></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Berapa lama proses pengerjaan?</summary><p>Waktu pengerjaan bergantung pada jumlah produk dan jenis layanan. Estimasi jadwal diberikan setelah brief disepakati.</p></details><details><summary>Apakah bisa request konsep sendiri?</summary><p>Tentu. Anda dapat mengirim referensi visual, moodboard, dan arahan brand. Tim kami juga bisa membantu mengembangkan konsep.</p></details><details><summary>Apakah tersedia layanan datang ke lokasi?</summary><p>Ya, sesi di lokasi dapat didiskusikan berdasarkan kebutuhan produksi, area, dan jadwal tim.</p></details><details><summary>Bagaimana dengan revisi?</summary><p>Ketentuan revisi disepakati di awal dan dicantumkan dalam penawaran proyek.</p></details><details><summary>Metode pembayaran apa saja yang tersedia?</summary><p>Metode dan termin pembayaran dapat dikonfirmasi saat konsultasi.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="section contact" id="contact"><div class="wrap contact-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Contact us</div><h2 class="heading">Let’s Create<br>Something Great.</h2><p class="copy">Kami siap membantu Anda mewujudkan visual terbaik untuk brand Anda.</p><div class="contact-list"><p><b>☎</b> +62 812 3456 7890</p><p><b>✉</b> hello@noirstudio.id</p><p><b>◷</b> Senin–Sabtu, 09.00–18.00</p><p><b>⌖</b> Jl. Melati No. 12, Jakarta Selatan</p></div></div><iframe class="map" title="Peta lokasi studio Jakarta Selatan" loading="lazy" src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Jakarta%20Selatan%2C%20Indonesia&t=&z=13&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed" allowfullscreen></iframe><div class="studio"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366754035-f200968a6e72?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=85" alt="Interior studio kreatif"><h3>Visit Our Studio</h3><p class="copy">Experience our creative space and discuss your project in person.</p><a class="btn gold" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Jakarta+Selatan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get Directions →</a></div></div></section>
</main>
